  "usbFixedVolumeDescription": "For DACs without a volume control accessible to the app. Keep off for USB headsets without their own volume control. Applies from the next track.",
  "usbFixedVolumeWarning": "The app cannot lower the volume on this output. Audio may start at full level, and the phone volume slider will not help. Only continue after lowering the volume on your DAC or external amplifier. Do not enable this for a headset without its own volume control.",
  "dapExclusive": "DAP hi-res (AAudio exclusive)",
  "dapExclusiveDescription": "Use Oboe/AAudio at the track's original rate and precision for FLAC/WAV PCM. Requires Android 8.1 or later and compatible hardware. Exclusive access is checked; unavailable formats use normal playback. DSD requires the direct USB driver. Applies from the next track.",
  "dapExclusiveUnavailable": "AAudio exclusive access is unavailable for this track and current output. Using normal playback. For a USB DAC, try the direct USB driver.",
  "exclusiveOutputWindows": "WASAPI exclusive mode",
  "exclusiveOutputMacos": "Exclusive access (hog mode)",
  "exclusiveOutputLinux": "Direct ALSA output",
  "exclusiveOutputDescriptionWindows": "Bypass the Windows mixer so the output follows each track's sample rate and bit depth. Other apps cannot play sound while Mornye holds the device. AutoMix and previews are off in this mode. For bit-perfect output, keep the volume at 100% with the equalizer and normalization off.",
  "exclusiveOutputDescriptionMacos": "Hold the output device for Mornye alone and switch it to each track's sample rate and bit depth, so Core Audio does not resample. Other apps cannot play sound while Mornye holds the device. AutoMix and previews are off in this mode. For bit-perfect output, keep the volume at 100% with the equalizer and normalization off.",
  "exclusiveOutputDescriptionLinux": "Play straight to an ALSA hardware device, bypassing PipeWire or PulseAudio, so the output follows each track's sample rate and bit depth. The device must be free: the sound server releases an idle card after a few seconds, or set its profile to Off. AutoMix and previews are off in this mode.",
  "exclusiveOutputPending": "Takes the device when a track plays.",
  "exclusiveOutputActive": "Playing in exclusive mode.",
  "exclusiveOutputUnavailableWindows": "The device refused exclusive access, so this track plays through the Windows mixer. Close other apps using the device, or allow exclusive control in the device's Windows sound properties.",
  "exclusiveOutputUnavailableMacos": "Another app holds the output device, so this track plays through the system mixer.",
  "exclusiveOutputUnavailableLinux": "The ALSA device is busy, usually held by the sound server, so this track plays through it. Set the card's profile to Off in the sound settings, or choose another device.",
